OL,3,GNEWSATaoiseach to attend PSNI student
OL,4,Aofficers passing out event
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Taoiseach (Irish prime minister)
OL,7,FMicheal Martin is to mark the 25th
OL,8,Fanniversary of the Police Service of
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland (PSNI) by attending a
OL,10,Fpassing out event for student officers
OL,11,Fin Belfast on Friday.
OL,13,FIt is the first time that an Irish
OL,14,Fprime minister has been to one of the
OL,15,Fceremonies.
OL,17,FAlong with Secretary of State Sir Chris
OL,18,FBryant, he will watch about 40 student
OL,19,Fofficers affirm the oath of office at
OL,20,Fthe PSNI's training college in east
OL,21,FBelfast.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
