OL,3,GNEWSATaoiseach to attend PSNI student
OL,4,Aofficers passing out event
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking ahead of the event, Martin
OL,7,Fpaid tribute to the PSNI and said that
OL,8,Fit was "a key part of delivering the
OL,9,FGood Friday Agreement and the peace
OL,10,Fthat it made possible".
